  "notes": [
   "«قالوا حدثنا وكيع» makes أبو كريب، وهناد، وقتيبة one level of co-transmitters; «قال وحدثنا محمد بن بشار» opens the second branch",
   "shared tail: the names after the last «ح» (زيد، عطاء، ابن عباس) belong to both routes",
   "two variant groups: the Rushdin remark (through الضحاك and عمر) and the remark «والصحيح ما روى ابن عجلان ...» which names other first-level transmitters for the same saying; both are written in full, not as routes",
   "«وليس هذا بشيء» and the other judgments carry no chain and are left out"
  ],
